                        "entry_id": "92230ffa-2124-36ad-b6e4-43cd1c51fd47",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a male given name, Tryphon or Trifon"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1fc0341-79ef-40bd-aae3-72fd2609c73c",
                                "sense_id": "96e7f364-2f93-343a-8378-a5e5bf6006f3",
                                "text": "Мы се́ли в префера́нс по копе́йке. Три́фон Ива́ныч вы́играл у меня́ два рубля́ с полти́ной — и ушёл по́здно, весьма́ дово́льный свое́й побе́дой.",
                                "translation": "We sat down to preference for halfpenny points. Trifon Ivanich won two rubles and a half from me, and went home late, well pleased with his success.",
                                "english": "We sat down to preference for halfpenny points. Trifon Ivanich won two rubles and a half from me, and went home late, well pleased with his success."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
